        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic physical path" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動選擇股道與月台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting at %@ to meet %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 %@ 等候 %@ 交會"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standing aside at %@ for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 %@ 待避 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ station, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 車站，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld assigned · %lld on a trip" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已指派 %lld 列 · 運行中 %lld 列"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld saves" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld save"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld saves"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 個存檔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld units per game minute" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每遊戲分鐘 %lld 單位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A managed company's city sets each station's ridership. Free play can change it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "經營模式下，各站的客流由城市決定；自由模式可以修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A minute later or earlier; the stops after it move with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次加減一分鐘；之後的停靠站一起移動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A minute longer or shorter, never shorter than the timetable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次加減一分鐘，不會短於整份時刻表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new stop comes 3 minutes after the last one and waits a minute; move its times with the steppers. Swipe a stop to remove it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的停靠站排在上一站 3 分鐘後，停 1 分鐘；用加減按鈕調整時刻。向左滑可刪除停靠站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preset keeps the station's daily trips. They go to the stations its lines reach that have ridership, shared by their own daily trips." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預設會保留車站的日客流。旅次分給路線能到、而且有客流的車站，依各站自己的日客流分配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A save file from Files or another device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從「檔案」或其他裝置匯入的存檔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A service starts at the first stop: put the train there and run it. An early train waits for its departure; a late one leaves once boarding is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服務從第一站開始：把列車放在那裡再開始。早到的列車等到發車時刻；誤點的列車上下車完就開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Pattern" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入交路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Platform" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設置月台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Selected Station" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入選取的車站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Stop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入停靠站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Stop at the End" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在最後加入停靠站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a short working or express" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入區間車或快車"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An empty map and %@ to build with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空白地圖，以及 %@ 的建設資金"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply to Its Lines" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "套用到全線路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrive" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "到站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assign %@ Here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 %@ 指派到這裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Autosave" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自動存檔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to Start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回到開始畫面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前餘額"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build Here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在這裡建造"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build Track" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鋪設軌道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build Track · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鋪設軌道 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Along the Line is a railway and city-building simulation where the railway shapes the growth of the city." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "《沿線》是一款鐵路與城市發展模擬遊戲。玩家規劃鐵路、車站與運輸網路，而城市會沿著交通建設逐步成長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build on a map of a real place" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在真實地點的地圖上建造"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buy a train for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花 %@ 購買列車"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buy · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "購買 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By train count" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "依上線列車數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cash %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現金 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charge a flat fare of %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "改收固定票價 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charge by distance (standard steps)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "改收階梯票價（標準區段）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Network to build track, platforms and stations. Selecting only inspects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇「路網」來鋪設軌道、設置月台與車站。「選取」只會檢視。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a station" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇車站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose what kind of place the station serves. A station without ridership starts no trips and draws none." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇車站服務的地區類型。沒有客流的車站不會產生旅次，也不會吸引旅次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses how fast game time runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇遊戲時間的倍速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses how it accelerates, brakes and how fast it may run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇加速、減速與最高速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses the train to control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇要操作的列車。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear Timetable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除時刻表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete this step to continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成這一步後才能繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "繼續"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy Ridership" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "複製客流設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create Line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建立路線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data Sources" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "資料來源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo Map" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "示範地圖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Design speed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設計時速"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dismiss message" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "關閉訊息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each car is 16 m long. A train of several cars needs track behind it, and platforms as long as it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每節車廂長 16 公尺。多節的列車後方要有軌道，月台也要和列車一樣長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ease the grade" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緩和坡度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Economy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "經濟明細"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit stop %lld, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯第 %lld 站，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Energy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "能源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entries" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "進站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entries start their trip here and exits end it here. Tap a bar to read its hour." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "進站是從這裡出發的旅次，出站是在這裡結束的旅次。點一下長條可查看該小時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every line runs its peak, off-peak and low trains in these bands. Swipe a band to remove it; the band before it runs on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條路線依這些時段開出尖峰、離峰與低峰的列車。向左滑可刪除時段，由前一個時段延續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone released here is waiting, riding, arrived, left a full station or gave up. Left behind counts the times a full train left people waiting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
