    "Services share every stretch of the line: at most one train every 2 minutes each way, the line's own service first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各服務共用路線的每一段：每個方向最多每 2 分鐘一班，路線本身的服務優先。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets when its trips start and end over the day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "決定一天中旅次何時出發、何時抵達。"
