    "Tutorial" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "教學"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two lines already running, with passengers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已有兩條路線在營運，也有乘客"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, a train takes its whole route before it leaves, and other trains wait until it has cleared it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟時，列車出發前會預約整條進路，其他列車要等它讓出進路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With network routes, passengers change lines and walk to stations nearby; otherwise they ride only a line serving both stations." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，乘客會轉乘其他線路，也會步行到附近的車站；關閉時只搭兩站都停靠的線路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
